Responsibilities:
- ​Lead end-to-end project delivery, ensuring projects are delivered on time, within budget, and to the highest quality standards while meeting customer satisfaction and financial objectives;

- Coordinate cross-functional teams, subcontractors, and global engineering teams to ensure successful project execution;

- Build strong relationships with customers, subcontractors, and internal stakeholders, ensuring effective communication and contractual compliance;

- Monitor project performance, manage risks and mitigation plans, and ensure compliance with Thales Project Management governance;

- Identify opportunities for process improvement and business growth;

- Support bid and proposal activities by contributing to competitive, high-quality project plans aligned with Thales governance.

